qRBlxF2ItAOvk-NVhUGazphPkRznQ7LfjjoRGsVxZDTUW96Xi1TS9cI3hFdbGVD9Q26F2RBSIf5WlcRNycxCNI67HVOrDDLFc199Ee7RCroJP1-iBukMjXrdkkBv5p7RB1TUx6gCMxcVlXqu8Oozr5jgNFlc8-E68b43oYp5HBuhV7mrEUQPKzUmprUSWJ3zLcWrRT4rzS__Xgex1CaVu1JJisxaelY3JCIFGLlCp_OZVslShCpRHSDPCT1E-HrV5CPvxiIpm1wzTDP153MtaQr2g8v0nUhwWwJYRJKv3zSxDGniBq8sc1GLvdngkveBTHkds1cLlSQXVFgqHl4RjyyFp8I4P0rYFBwGZzhdL2d9","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"![Feature Image](/tmp/memecoinist-run-20260610-130944/media/feature.jpg)\n\nMETA\n- SEO Title: Chainlink to Power Myriad's World Cup Prediction Markets\n- Meta Description: Myriad is tapping Chainlink prediction markets to power its 2026 FIFA World Cup hub, enabling instant, automated payouts for all matches.\n- URL Slug: chainlink-prediction-markets-myriad-world-cup\n- Categories: Sports-based memecoins, Community Buzz\n- Primary Keyword: Chainlink prediction markets\n- Secondary Keywords: Myriad, FIFA World Cup, prediction markets\n\n---\n\n# Myriad Taps Chainlink to Power FIFA World Cup Prediction Markets\n\nPrediction market platform Myriad is adopting Chainlink as its exclusive oracle infrastructure for 2026 FIFA World Cup matches, a move that will leverage **Chainlink prediction markets** to automate and accelerate how wagers are settled. The integration builds on Myriad’s existing use of the Chainlink Runtime Environment (CRE) for its crypto price markets, signaling a deeper reliance on Chainlink’s technology for high-profile events. Myriad’s goal is to turn the global sporting event into an opportunity to convert first-time users into long-term traders through reliable and instant settlements.\n\nThe announcement follows a busy period for Myriad, which recently closed a milestone seed funding round and launched on the BNB Chain. With its new funding and expanded technical capabilities, the company is positioning itself to capture a significant share of the rapidly growing prediction market sector, which has seen platforms like Polymarket and Kalshi achieve multi-billion-dollar valuations.\n\n## Chainlink and Myriad: A Strategic Partnership for High-Stakes Prediction Markets"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":44,"aggregated":"![Feature Image](/tmp/memecoinist-run-20260610-130944/media/feature.jpg)\n\nMETA\n- SEO Title: Chainlink to Power Myriad's World Cup Prediction Markets\n- Meta Description: Myriad is tapping Chainlink prediction markets to power its 2026 FIFA World Cup hub, enabling instant, automated payouts for all matches.\n- URL Slug: chainlink-prediction-markets-myriad-world-cup\n- Categories: Sports-based memecoins, Community Buzz\n- Primary Keyword: Chainlink prediction markets\n- Secondary Keywords: Myriad, FIFA World Cup, prediction markets\n\n---\n\n# Myriad Taps Chainlink to Power FIFA World Cup Prediction Markets\n\nPrediction market platform Myriad is adopting Chainlink as its exclusive oracle infrastructure for 2026 FIFA World Cup matches, a move that will leverage **Chainlink prediction markets** to automate and accelerate how wagers are settled. The integration builds on Myriad’s existing use of the Chainlink Runtime Environment (CRE) for its crypto price markets, signaling a deeper reliance on Chainlink’s technology for high-profile events. Myriad’s goal is to turn the global sporting event into an opportunity to convert first-time users into long-term traders through reliable and instant settlements.\n\nThe announcement follows a busy period for Myriad, which recently closed a milestone seed funding round and launched on the BNB Chain. With its new funding and expanded technical capabilities, the company is positioning itself to capture a significant share of the rapidly growing prediction market sector, which has seen platforms like Polymarket and Kalshi achieve multi-billion-dollar valuations.\n\n## Chainlink and Myriad: A Strategic Partnership for High-Stakes Prediction Markets","cwd":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-publisher"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1781098316552}}
